WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.031 --> 00:00:10.390
A fire warrior flew down and grabbed the salamander and the jar.

2
00:00:10.391 --> 00:00:16.040
"This salamander escaped from a pond in the Jade Emperor's garden," he explained.

3
00:00:16.041 --> 00:00:25.271
"The jar belongs to Laozi, but the salamander stole it. I'll bring them both back."

4
00:00:25.272 --> 00:00:29.811
The warrior flew back up into the clouds.

5
00:00:29.812 --> 00:00:33.132
"Wow," Roxy said.

6
00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:35.249
People ran over.

7
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.116
"Thank you for getting rid of the demon!" a woman said.

8
00:00:39.117 --> 00:00:46.155
"We live in a village near the mountain. Please join us for a feast."

9
00:00:46.156 --> 00:00:53.969
*** Bajie was drooling. "Yum—noodles, vegetables, and

10
00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:58.982
dumplings!" "We can finally have our picnic," Mara said

11
00:00:58.983 --> 00:01:07.065
happily. "Watch this." Bajie lifted a bowl of noodles and dumped them into his mouth.

12
00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:12.794
Gulp! "Bajie!" Wujing said. "You should be

13
00:01:12.795 --> 00:01:19.697
ashamed!" Bajie let out a huge burp, and Mara

14
00:01:19.698 --> 00:01:23.556
snorted. "I have a hard time being good too," Jack said to Wukong.

15
00:01:23.557 --> 00:01:25.827
"I can never sit still at school."

16
00:01:25.828 --> 00:01:34.167
Wukong grinned. "I got in big trouble with my teacher, Subodhi, a long time ago.

17
00:01:34.168 --> 00:01:38.101
You should try meditating—it helps me to stay calm."

18
00:01:38.102 --> 00:01:45.075
Wukong showed Jack how to close his eyes and breathe slowly.

19
00:01:45.076 --> 00:01:49.641
Suddenly Jack felt himself floating, and his eyes flew open.

20
00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:55.162
"Whoa!" Jack said. "I'm flying—like Rocket Girl!"

21
00:01:55.163 --> 00:02:01.691
"It's magic!" Wukong laughed and lowered Jack back down.

22
00:02:01.692 --> 00:02:07.969
"Roxy," Terrell asked quietly, "is this the world where you were when you were missing?"

23
00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:14.575
Roxy nodded. "I was stuck here fighting that demon for a while."

24
00:02:14.576 --> 00:02:18.275
"I wish I could have helped you," Terrell said.

25
00:02:18.276 --> 00:02:24.014
"I don't think you could have helped, Terrell. The demon was really powerful."

26
00:02:24.015 --> 00:02:27.777
"Excuse me, Rocket Girl," Wujing interrupted.

27
00:02:27.778 --> 00:02:32.296
"Can you teach me how to shoot fire from my eyes before you leave?"

28
00:02:32.297 --> 00:02:36.171
"I can try."

29
00:02:36.172 --> 00:02:43.400
As Roxy and Wujing wandered away from the table, Terrell let out a deep sigh.

30
00:02:43.401 --> 00:02:47.763
The Tang Monk sat down beside him. "What's wrong?"

31
00:02:47.764 --> 00:02:53.640
"I want to help Rocket Girl, but I don't have any super powers," Terrell said.

32
00:02:53.641 --> 00:02:57.072
"I don't have super powers either," the Tang Monk said.

33
00:02:57.073 --> 00:03:00.784
"But that doesn't mean I can't help my friends.

34
00:03:00.785 --> 00:03:05.757
Wukong, Bajie, and Wujing committed terrible crimes long ago.

35
00:03:05.758 --> 00:03:09.120
Now I'm helping them to be good and earn forgiveness.

36
00:03:09.121 --> 00:03:13.462
I'm sure you'll eventually find a way to help your friend."

37
00:03:13.463 --> 00:03:18.889
"I hope so." Terrell nodded, but he still felt uncertain.

38
00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:23.896
He'd tried to help Roxy many times before.

39
00:03:23.897 --> 00:03:28.559
At last it was time for the Tang Monk and his companions to continue their journey. Wukong

40
00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:32.406
opened the portal. "Good-bye!"

41
00:03:32.407 --> 00:03:38.097
everyone said. Roxy

42
00:03:38.098 --> 00:03:55.887
smiled at Wukong. "Be good!" ***

43
00:03:55.888 --> 00:04:00.725
"Hey, guys!" Roxy found her friends in Metro City Park.

44
00:04:00.726 --> 00:04:04.943
Jack raised an eyebrow. "How did you know we were here?"

45
00:04:04.944 --> 00:04:12.693
Roxy gulped. "Oh no," she thought. "What should I say?"

46
00:04:12.694 --> 00:04:16.590
"I texted her," Terrell blurted out.

47
00:04:16.591 --> 00:04:22.595
"Yeah, I talked to Roxy earlier, and she said she was away, visiting family.

48
00:04:22.596 --> 00:04:26.486
She just got back, so I told her to come and meet us here."

49
00:04:26.487 --> 00:04:33.689
Roxy nodded. "Yep, that's right!" She shot Terrell a look that silently said, "thank you."

50
00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:37.407
A big smile formed across Terrell's face.

51
00:04:37.408 --> 00:04:43.683
"Roxy," Mara said. "We have a huge story to tell you."

52
00:04:43.684 --> 00:04:59.969
Jack nodded excitedly. "You won't believe what you missed!"

